{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん～～～～～！ななせまる！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は気がついたら夜になってしまったのでブログできませんでした...すいません"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ、ついに顔痩せしようかと言われれてしまいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうですよね。確実に顔が太っていっているのは薄々気付いていました(ﾉ)'ω`(ヾ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなわけで昨日の昨日の昨日くらいから真剣に痩せる計画を実行してますえへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○状況○"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"炭水化物 封印！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"三食は一応食べる(お腹いっぱいは食べない)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"故に常軽く空腹"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"切り札のおやつはトマト"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"湯船には毎日浸かる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とことんリンパマッサージ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"効果あるかなー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いまの口癖はおなかすいたーですね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いまは辛いけどこの生活に慣れたら大丈夫なはずなのでがんばろっ！自分の為やし(ｏ'∀'人)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー写真がない...ので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"懐かしいやつ貼っときます！ふっふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/07/4644299/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はじめてキューズモールにいったとき！懐かしい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにななのキューズのポイントカードは黄色です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと東京ぜんあくのときの夜ご飯"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/07/4644299/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いんげんが大好きやからいっぱい入れたら、かずみさんに「おかしいよなぁちゃん普通は2.3本だよー！これブログに載せるべきだよ」と言われたのを思い出した"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いんげん大好き！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問にこたえる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●走るのすき？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すきです。でも測ったりするんはすきじゃない..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●スタバのメニューでなにがすき？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バニラモカかにゃ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●卒業後の進路どうするの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美大にいきたいです。いきたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宿題がまだあるのでやってきますえへ(ﾟ-ﾟ；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バイッッッ"}],"source":"archive"}